{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "vidbrief transcript.json / transcript.fixed.json",
  "description": "结构化转录。原始文件 01_preprocess/transcript.json 的 conclusion 恒为 null;02_calibrate/transcript.fixed.json 是带结论的全量副本,两者共用本 schema。设计见 docs/DESIGN.md §4.5、§6.2。",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "source",
    "model",
    "language",
    "duration",
    "generated_at",
    "segments"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "source": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/relpath",
      "description": "被转录的视频在项目内的位置"
    },
    "model": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "description": "ASR 模型标识,如 ggml-medium"
    },
    "language": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "description": "语言代码,如 zh"
    },
    "duration": {
      "type": "number",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "generated_at": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp",
      "description": "转录音频的时间。transcript.fixed.json 沿用原始值,不因纠错而更新"
    },
    "segments": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "按 start 升序,区间互不重叠",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "id",
          "start",
          "end",
          "text",
          "conclusion",
          "checked_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "等于 SRT 里的序号,从 1 起"
          },
          "start": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "end": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "ASR 原始输出,永不就地改写"
          },
          "conclusion": {
            "description": "对这一段下的结论。null = 没话说(也可能还没看过 —— 看 checked_at)。五种结论互斥且穷尽:corrected 改了字 / punctuated **只加标点(字一个没动)** / kept 决定保留原句 / uncertain 存疑留给人 / null 没问题。**「改了」与「加了标点」的文本就在它里面**,不给它单开一栏 —— 那样两者能各说各话(实测:结论说要改、文本栏空着,数数时整整一档掉在地上)。⚠️ **投影**:判据在 state.bin(见 docs/DESIGN.md §4.10);原始转录里恒为 null",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "null"
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "outcome",
                  "text",
                  "type",
                  "note",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "outcome": {
                    "const": "corrected",
                    "description": "改了字 —— 新文本就在这条里"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "改后的整句"
                  },
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "homophone",
                      "terminology",
                      "number",
                      "other"
                    ],
                    "description": "错的性质:homophone=同音错字;terminology=术语/专有名词;number=数字/单位/时间;other=其它"
                  },
                  "note": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "改动内容,如「派森 → Python」;kept/uncertain 时写为什么这么定"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "判断依据(画面文字 / 上下文 / 术语表)"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "outcome",
                  "text"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "outcome": {
                    "const": "punctuated",
                    "description": "**只加标点 / 断句** —— 一个字都没动。判据:去掉标点与空白之后必须与 text(ASR 原文)一字不差;工具按这条自检,动了字就退回收成 corrected。单开一档是为了账:断句会把几乎每段都写一遍,混进 corrected 里,真改了字的那几段就找不出来了"
                  },
                  "text": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "加了标点之后的整段"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "outcome",
                  "note",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "outcome": {
                    "const": "kept",
                    "description": "看过,决定保留原句"
                  },
                  "note": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "改动内容,如「派森 → Python」;kept/uncertain 时写为什么这么定"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "判断依据(画面文字 / 上下文 / 术语表)"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "outcome",
                  "note",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "outcome": {
                    "const": "uncertain",
                    "description": "看过但定不了,留给用户裁决。疑似写法写在 note 里"
                  },
                  "note": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "改动内容,如「派森 → Python」;kept/uncertain 时写为什么这么定"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "判断依据(画面文字 / 上下文 / 术语表)"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "checked_at": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "null"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/timestamp"
              }
            ],
            "description": "模型**核验过这一段**的时刻。null = 还没核验。这是「跳过某一段」唯一看得出来得的地方 —— 整份记一个标记,跳了 300 段也看不出。三种核验结论的读法见 docs/DESIGN.md §4.5。⚠️ **投影**:判据在 state.bin(§4.10)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "timestamp": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time",
      "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]+)?(Z|[+-][0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2})$"
    },
    "relpath": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "pattern": "^[^/.\\\\:][^/\\\\:]*(/[^/.\\\\:][^/\\\\:]*)*$"
    }
  }
}
